  "description": "An Umbraco plugin that exports your existing Umbraco schema and content to YAML format. Exports DataTypes, DocumentTypes, Media Types, Templates, Content, Media, Languages, Dictionary Items, Members, and Users to a declarative Infrastructure-as-Code YAML file. Supports Umbraco 14–17. For Umbraco 13, use v1.x.",
